# Domain commands (ADR-0006)

Mutations live in `lib/<context>/commands/`, not controllers.

- Use `write_transaction` (from `ApplicationCommand`) and validate tenant scope.
- Prefer inheriting `ApplicationCommand`; expose via `CommandBus.dispatch`.
- Call `RecordPlatformEvent` when the change crosses contexts, uses a type in `Cidadaobr::KafkaTopics::ALL`, or is an audit-worthy transition (`event_type:` constant only; topic defaults to the same string).
- Gold pattern: `Scheduling::BookAppointment`, `Ledi::ValidateClinicalRecord`.

Skill: `.cursor/skills/cidadaobr-platform-write-refactor/SKILL.md`
